msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The guard seemed to try to act as if it had been his idea to split the sides up, but Sarah didn't bother to argue."
msgstr "O guarda parecia tentar agir como se a ideia de separar os lados tivesse sido dele, mas Sarah nem se deu ao trabalho de discutir."

