msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Though she had managed to make some progress on her own, she realized that Metis' instruction was invaluable."
msgstr "Embora ela tivesse conseguido fazer algum progresso por conta própria, percebeu que as instruções de Metis eram inestimáveis."

msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "So, ready for your next lesson?"
