msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Well, quite a lot I suppose...but we'll be careful, right?"
msgstr "Bem, bastante coisa, suponho... mas vamos ter cuidado, certo?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hesitantly, Sarah nodded. Perhaps she'd bitten off more than she could chew."
msgstr "Hesitantemente, Sarah assentiu. Talvez ela tivesse mordido mais do que conseguia mastigar."

